    <selectionEntry name="[E] - Bagrian, sumo sacerdote de Taal, abad de la Maisontaal" id="9bcf-7d4a-eb5e-40c0" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="unit">
      <categoryLinks>
        <categoryLink name="Comandantes" id="d9f0-a7cc-ab16-115b" hidden="false" primary="true" targetId="4c6f72647323232344415441232323"/>
